sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client
    participant API as API (coordinator)
    participant S3 as Object storage

    C->>API: POST /uploads {name, size, hash}
    API->>S3: CreateMultipartUpload
    API-->>C: uploadId + presigned part URLs
    C->>S3: PUT parts 1..36 (parallel)
    Note over C: network drops
    C->>API: GET status → parts 1-36 confirmed
    C->>S3: resume from part 37
    C->>API: POST complete {etags}
    API->>S3: CompleteMultipartUpload + verify
